stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Admitting
  Admitting --> Sealed: hold(instance, revision) on node
  Sealed --> Draining: deny new admission for subtree
  Draining --> Interrupting: issued permits drained
  Draining --> HeldFailed: drain timeout
  Interrupting --> Held: interrupt_for_host returned for all
  Interrupting --> HeldFailed: missing controller or error
  HeldFailed --> Interrupting: retry interruption
  Held --> Admitting: explicit readmit (current revision)
  Held --> Held: parent readmit keeps independent child hold
